| **Role-Based Access** | `withRoleGuard` HOC on mobile, `ProtectedRoute` on web, 12-role hierarchy |

### 🔴 Critical Gaps (Blocking Production)

| # | Gap | Impact |
|---|-----|--------|
| 1 | **No Shop Owner Portal** — Shop owners can register but cannot manage products, view orders, set appointments, or update profiles | Shops can't operate |
| 2 | **No Complete Order Flow** — No cart→checkout→payment→tracking pipeline. Missing: delivery/pickup/dine-in options | Users can't order |
| 3 | **No Appointment Booking UI** — DB schema exists (`shop_type='appointment'`) but no booking interface | Service shops unusable |
| 4 | **No Push Notifications** — `notification.routes.js` is 350 bytes (nearly empty), no Firebase/FCM integration | Users miss orders/alerts |
| 5 | **No File/Image Upload** — No S3/MinIO/Cloudinary integration. Products, profiles, posts all lack image upload | No visual content |
| 6 | **No Real Payment Checkout** — Razorpay initialized but no complete checkout flow on web or mobile | Can't collect money |
| 7 | **Hardcoded Mock Data Everywhere** — Web pages use `useState([...mock])`, mobile uses `const MOCK = [...]`. No API calls on 90% of pages | Nothing is real |
| 8 | **No Order Notifications to Shop** — When user places order, shop owner receives nothing | Orders are lost |
| 9 | **Admin configs not persisted** — Revenue split sliders reset on page reload, no `admin_config` table usage | Admin changes lost |
| 10 | **No Search/Discovery Engine** — Basic `filter()` on mock arrays, no full-text search, no geo-proximity sorting | Users can't find things |

