### Phase 2: Complete Order Flow (3 Delivery Modes)
> **Priority: 🔴 CRITICAL — This is the core transaction engine**

#### Order Flow Design:
```
User browses shop → Adds to cart → Selects mode:
  ├── 🏠 Home Delivery (delivery fee applies)
  ├── 🏃 Self Pickup (no delivery fee, OTP verification)
  └── 🪑 Dine-in / Visit (for restaurants/salons)
→ Checkout with payment (Wallet/UPI/COD)
→ Order notification to shop owner (real-time via Socket.io)
→ Shop accepts → Prepares → Ready
→ If delivery: Runner assigned → Picked up → Delivered (OTP)
→ If pickup: User gets notification when ready, shows OTP at shop
→ If dine-in: Reservation confirmed with time slot
```

#### [NEW] `apps/web/src/app/shops/[id]/page.js`
- Individual shop page with full product catalog
- Add-to-cart functionality with quantity selector
- Cart drawer/sidebar with running total
- Checkout page with address selection, delivery mode toggle, payment method
- Order confirmation with estimated time

#### [MODIFY] `apps/mobile/app/modules/shop-detail/index.js`
- Complete rewrite: product grid, cart, checkout flow, 3 delivery modes

#### [NEW] `backend/src/routes/order.routes.js`
- `POST /orders` — Create order with items, delivery mode, payment
- `GET /orders/:id` — Order details with live status
- `PUT /orders/:id/status` — Update order status (shop owner)
