## Role-Based Access Design

| Role | Access |
|------|--------|
| **Visitor** (unauthenticated) | Browse shops, view community, see listings |
| **User** (registered) | Order, post, carpool, marketplace, wallet, refer |
| **Resident Member** | All User + Society management, gate pass, maintenance |
| **Society Admin** | All Resident + Notice board, complaints, facility booking |
| **Security Guard** | Visitor check-in/out, vehicle log |
| **Shop Owner** | Shop dashboard, product CRUD, order management, analytics |
| **Service Provider** | Service listing, appointment management, earnings |
| **Delivery Agent** | Available orders, delivery tracking, earnings |
| **Field Agent** | Lead generation, shop onboarding, territory ops |
| **Area Agent** | Multi-zone oversight, agent management |
| **Territory Admin** | Franchise dashboard, commission tracking |
| **Moderator** | Content moderation, flagged posts, user reports |
| **Super Admin** | Everything + revenue config + platform settings |

